  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BOOSTING THE DECENT RURAL EMPLOYMENT AND DIMITRA WORK</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This phase of the project aims at enhancing efforts to boost decent farm and non-farm jobs opportunities for rural youth, including for the age group 15-17, reducing child labour in agriculture and enabling rural women and men, including the most vulnerable and those living in protracted crisis, to better organize, access resources and a voice in decision-making processes, and be empowered.</narrative>
  </description>
